 "limits": "The lift is a plain paired difference of judge means; it carries no confidence interval or significance test, and every judge counts equally whatever its reliability (judge_agreement measures that). Items a model answered under one arm only are counted but not used. Scores are taken on one scale, so mixing rubrics in one input makes the means meaningless. Arm, model, item and judge names compare exactly.",
